{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D / 3D Chess Game with new figures and various boards.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on boards with 5x5 to 16x16 fields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 new Figures: Wizard, Gamma and Keeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ play modes: Single Layer, 3D Stacked Game, Random Attack Games, and Tower Challenge. Play chess or antichess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D and 2D views.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor and Community Presets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on one computer, online with your friends or against the AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Anti-Chess mode for all single-level games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Stacked: Play on several levels: Each hit figure will be your trophy on the next level. Since a level is done (check or draw), the game continues on the next level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Mode: Play several sized games. The best player wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online: Play against other users online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Game: Attach to online games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snapshots: Create a game snapshot and resume any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between different visualizations. Board Style, Darkmode, Fullsized Windows, hint fields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy distribution of game sets between users.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for FullHD+ displays.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2077200?t=1748971015","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748971015","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/20